# Scope

- **Markets:** Crypto OHLCV (parquet/CSV under `data/`) only.
- **Strategies:** Rule-based long/short backtests for research.
- **Outputs:** Structured folders under `runs/<run_id>/`.
- **Not in scope:** Live execution, equities, options, alt-data engineering beyond `data/README_DATA_FORMAT.md`.

Say no to out-of-scope requests and offer the closest in-scope alternative.
